text":"그","x":1575,"y":1676,"width":32,"height":26},{"text":"메시지는","x":1622,"y":1670,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"7비트","x":1765,"y":1672,"width":82,"height":38}]},{"text":"ASCII로 인코딩되어야 한다. 반면에 HTTP 데이터는 이런 제한이 없다.","words":[{"text":"ASCII로","x":569,"y":1732,"width":132,"height":30},{"text":"인코딩되어야","x":715,"y":1728,"width":196,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":922,"y":1730,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"반면에","x":1011,"y":1731,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"HTTP","x":1123,"y":1735,"width":94,"height":30},{"text":"데이터는","x":1232,"y":1730,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"이런","x":1377,"y":1731,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"제한이","x":1455,"y":1731,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"없다.","x":1569,"y":1732,"width":69,"height":39}]},{"text":"세 번째 중요한 차이점은 텍스트와 이미지(다른 미디어 타입도 포함 기능)로 구성","words":[{"text":"세","x":634,"y":1790,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"번째","x":681,"y":1790,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"중요한","x":758,"y":1791,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"차이점은","x":871,"y":1791,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"텍스트와","x":1018,"y":1792,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"이미지(다른","x":1165,"y":1792,"width":177,"height":40},{"text":"미디어","x":1356,"y":1792,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"타입도","x":1469,"y":1794,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"포함","x":1582,"y":1793,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"기능)로","x":1661,"y":1793,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"구성","x":1784,"y":1797,"width":60,"height":38}]},{"text":"된 문서를 다루는 방법이다. 2.2절에서 배운 것처럼, HITP는 자신의 HITP 응답 메시","words":[{"text":"된","x":571,"y":1852,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"문서를","x":614,"y":1852,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"다루는","x":726,"y":1852,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"방법이다.","x":836,"y":1853,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"2.2절에서","x":989,"y":1854,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"배운","x":1151,"y":1855,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"것처럼,","x":1230,"y":1853,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"HITP는","x":1348,"y":1856,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"자신의","x":1489,"y":1854,"width":96,"heigh